text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'All creatures are black.', 'All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'All lands are 2/2 creatures that are still lands.', 'As Engineered Plague enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\nAll creatures of the chosen type get -1/-1.', "As long as Static Orb is untapped, players can't untap more than two permanents during their untap steps.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, if Howling Mine is untapped, that player draws an additional card.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player puts the cards in their hand on the bottom of their library in any order, then draws that many cards.", "At the beginning of each player's end step, if that player didn't cast a spell this turn, Impatience deals 2 damage to that player.", 'At the beginning of your draw step, draw an additional card.\nAt the beginning of your end step, discard your hand.', 'Attacking creatures you control get +1/+0.', "Beast of Burden's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creatures on the battlefield.", 'Black creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Blaze deals X damage to any target.', 'Cast this spell only during your end step.\nAs an additional cost to cast this spell, pay X life.\nDraw X cards.', 'Change the target of target spell with a single target.', 'Charcoal Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B}.', 'Choose a color. Target player reveals their hand and discards all cards of that color.', 'Choose one —\n• Target player gains 3 life.\n• Prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', 'Corrupt deals damage to any target equal to the number of Swamps you control. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.', 'Counter target spell.', "Counter target spell. If that spell is countered this way, put it on top of its owner's library instead of into that player's graveyard.", 'Creature spells cost {2} more to cast.', "Creatures can't block.", "Creatures with power 3 or greater don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", "Creatures with power greater than the number of cards in your hand can't attack.", 'Creatures you control get +0/+2 until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Creatures you control have first strike.', 'Creatures you control have flying.', 'Creatures you control have haste. (They can attack and {T} as soon as they come under your control.)', "Creatures you control have menace. (They can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFirst strike", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFlying", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nFlying\nSunweb can't block creatures with power 2 or less.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{2}{U}{U}: Wall of Wonder gets +4/-4 until end of turn and can attack this turn as though it didn't have defender.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{B}: Regenerate Wall of Bone. (The next time this creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\n{R}: Wall of Fire gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", "Defender, flying (This creature can't attack, and it can block creatures with flying.)", 'Destroy X target nonblack creatures. Draw X cards.', 'Destroy all Islands.', 'Destroy all artifacts and enchantments.', "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all enchantments.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Destroy target artifact or land. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or land.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', "Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater. It can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target land or nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target land.', "Destroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Discard a land card: Seismic Assault deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Discard all the cards in your hand, then draw that many cards.', 'Disorder deals 2 damage to each white creature and each player who controls a white creature.', 'Draw four cards. You lose half your life, rounded up.', 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield that shares at least one creature type with it. (For example, if two Goblin Warriors and a Goblin Shaman are on the battlefield, each gets +2/+2.)', "Each creature you control can't be blocked by more than one creature.", "Each player can't cast more than one spell each turn.", 'Each player draws a card for each creature card in their graveyard.', "Each player may play an additional land during each of their turns.\nWhenever a land is tapped for mana, return it to its owner's hand.", 'Each player sacrifices four lands. Wildfire deals 4 damage to each creature.', 'Earthquake deals X damage to each creature without flying and each player.', 'Enchant artifact\nYou control enchanted artifact.', 'Enchant creature\nAll creatures able to block enchanted creature do so.', 'Enchant creature\nAll damage that would be dealt to you is dealt to enchanted creature instead.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 for each Mountain you control.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Forest you control.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has flying and vigilance.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has flying.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has swampwalk. (It can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Swamp.)", "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nEnchanted creature has first strike. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\n{G}: Regenerate enchanted creature. (The next time that creature would be destroyed this turn, it isn't. Instead tap it, remove all damage from it, and remove it from combat.)", 'Enchant land\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional {G}.', 'Enchant permanent\nYou control enchanted permanent.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Fire Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R}.', 'First strike', 'First strike; reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Flying', "Flying\nGoblin Glider can't block.", "Flying\nRevenant's power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.", 'Flying\nSacrifice a creature: Fallen Angel gets +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\nWhen Abyssal Horror enters the battlefield, target player discards two cards.', 'Flying\nWhen Cloudchaser Eagle enters the battlefield, destroy target enchantment.', 'Flying\nWhen Foul Imp enters the battlefield, you lose 2 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Sage Owl enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library, then put them back in any order.', 'Flying\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.', "Fl